# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# The demo's ingest keys are credentials, like demo-android's local.properties: config.json is the
# copy of config.example.json with them filled in, passed as --dart-define-from-file=config.json.
/config.json
# A real Firebase project's file; the Google services plugin is applied only when it is there.
/android/app/google-services.json
# Signing for a device: a developer team of your own (ios/Flutter/Signing.example.xcconfig).
/ios/Flutter/Signing.xcconfig
